# b00t Anthropic Desktop Extensions datum — MCPB packaging & integration
# 🤓 .tomllmd format — canonical reference for .mcpb/DXT extension integration
# schema: 1 | bump ONLY on field definition changes, NOT on new server entries
# last_updated: 2026-05-08 | authoritative metadata via git notes
#
# Defines the Anthropic Desktop Extensions specification for bundling MCP servers
# into self-contained .mcpb (MCP Bundle) installable packages.
#
# 🔗参 https://www.anthropic.com/engineering/desktop-extensions — engineering blog
# 🔗参 https://github.com/anthropics/dxt — open-source toolchain & spec
# 🔗参 https://github.com/anthropics/dxt/blob/main/MANIFEST.md — manifest spec v0.3
# 🔗参 _b00t_/datums/MCP-SERVER-SCHEMA.tomllmd — canonical MCP server datum schema
